# Advanced Agentic Mentor Architecture Plan

The goal is to upgrade the AI Mentor from a basic chatbot to a powerful, state-tracking Agentic Workflow system using n8n and our backend database. This involves setting up specialized workflows for Roadmap Generation, Code Mentorship, Progress Tracking, and Scheduled Motivations.

## Open Questions

> [!WARNING]
